ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "iso board gap", [8, 4, 3], "mm: the gap (the stock spacer, uncut), U-ISO's tails out of the iso board's front, and the most a main board rear-face part may stand under it (iso_board.under_h) - tails + parts + boards.part_clear inside the gap"
ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "J-B2B-ISO's insulator in the gap", 5.46, "mm from its top to the iso board's front face"
