ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "trimmers adjustable from behind", [["trim 5", 8.17819], ["trim 6", 10.681], ["trim 7", 2.36783], ["trim_smd 8", 2.50891]], "mm from each trimmer's centre to the nearest TALLER rear-face part - the iso board and what stands on it counted from the main board's rear face - less a 3 mm screwdriver's radius (rules.driver_d), with the module out of the rack; -1 = under the power ribbon's fold"
